  "strategy_ids": [],
  "solution_ref": "$6k=2$ → $k=\\frac13$. $\\mathrm P(2\\le Y\\le5)=\\int_2^5\\left(\\frac13-f\\right)dx$, $f=\\frac1{12}x$ ($0\\le x\\le3$). $=\\left\\{\\frac13-\\frac12\\left(\\frac16+\\frac14\\right)\\right\\}+\\left(\\frac13\\cdot2-\\frac14\\cdot2\\right)=\\frac18+\\frac16=\\frac7{24}$. $p+q=31$",
